    },
    {
      "id": "claim_449a3d2e890043eea6ae36e219a604ee",
      "statement": "The tree-wide topology-scrub gate flags any real tailnet *.ts.net host while allowing sanitized placeholders (any host containing 'tailnet' or 'example'), which is why the reserved range must be discussed as port numbers without a real host paired with a port.",
